			"Message": "docs(Common): Initialize documentation for Common crate\n\nCreate the root README.md file within the Documentation/Rust submodule to serve as the entry point for the Common crate's architectural documentation.\n\nThis file covers the abstract core, ActionEffect system, and trait definitions, establishing the necessary documentation structure for developers contributing to the core library.",
